# Day 05 Environment Variiables

## Jenkins Pipeline --  Use Environment Variables

pipeline{
    agent any
    environment {
        INTITUE_NAME: "' Pathnex"
    }
    stages{
        stage("Print") {
            steps{
                sh 'echo "Welcome to $INTITUE_NAME Devops Taining"
            }
        }
    stage('Build') {
        steps {
            sh 'mvn clean package -Distitue.name=$INSTITUE_NAME'
        }
    }
  }
}

